  "details": "While this could be multiple lucky coincidences, I found myself sitting around while nearby avatars downloaded for multiple minutes without much or any download progress. I logged off, swapped to live and joined the same instance and they downloaded at the expected speed. Swapping back to the beta again yielded the same results.\n\nI had to walk through a crowd of 15 or so people to get to the people I wanted to talk to and a few of them did load, possibly the download priority didn't change as I moved away?",
